---
sequenceDiagram
  participant H as People
  participant C as OCC API / IAM
  participant S as Original State
  H->>C: Admin enrolls / assigns
  C->>S: Settle + audit
  S-->>C: Outcome
  Note over H,S: Unknown: authorized lookup, no replay.
  H->>C: Open assigned Agent
  H->>C: Admin revokes
  C->>S: Commit revoke + audit
  Note over H,S: Committed revoke: deny + close within 30s. Bob continues.
